  "name": "Stereo Delay",
  "description": "Tempo-synced stereo delay with unity dry signal. Tempo (40\u2013180 BPM, default 120), Beats (1\u201316, default 4): echo interval = 60 * Beats / Tempo seconds. Feedback (0\u20130.9, default 0.5) scales every echo; zero is dry only. Stereo (0\u20131, default 0.5) blends preserved stereo with alternating mono-average echoes, first left, then right. Use as an insert. Set tempo manually; restart the rack after changing controls. Dry plus echoes can exceed full scale.",
